    metaTitle: "Wellness & Performance in Albuquerque, NM | Body1MD",
    headline: "Wellness & Performance in Albuquerque",
    description: "Nutrition optimization, fitness counseling, inspired goal setting and, if warranted, hormone optimization with Dr. Hemmen in Los Ranchos de Albuquerque.",
    heroSubhead: "Helping you achieve lasting wellness, vitality, and peak performance. Go beyond your best with physician-guided nutrition, fitness and goal setting, plus hormone optimization and peptide therapies if warranted.",
    heroImage: {"src": "/images/stock/wellness-and-performance.jpg", "alt": "Mature man choosing a dumbbell from the rack during a strength workout", "width": 1600, "height": 1066},
    introHeading: "Go Beyond Your Best",
    intro: ["Primary care keeps you healthy. Wellness and performance care helps you feel your best. Focused on body composition, fitness, motivation, and overall well-being, these personalized plans support sustainable lifestyle changes, improved energy, and long-term health.","After more than 20 years caring for hospitalized patients, Dr. Andy recognized that many serious illnesses were the result of preventable chronic disease. That realization inspired a professional shift toward the front end of health: not only preventing disease, but helping patients reach peak performance regardless of where they're starting.","We first make sure your core primary care needs are up to date, including preventive screenings, lipid management, and blood pressure control. We then build a personalized plan beyond optimizing your chronic conditions, including exercise, nutrition, hormone optimization, and peptide therapies if warranted, designed to help you feel your best, stay energized, and move confidently into the future."],
    signsHeading: "Wellness & Performance Services",
    signsList: ["Nutrition Optimization: customized plans incorporating nutrition, supplements, and lifestyle strategies to help you feel stronger, more energized, and at your best","Exercise and Fitness Counseling: strength and aerobic optimization for those desiring to reach their highest level of performance","Inspired Goal Setting: if you can see it, you can achieve it, with inspired goal setting and a realistic path to get there","Hormone Optimization: evaluated and considered only if warranted by your history, symptoms and lab work","Peptide Therapies: considered only if warranted, after a careful review of potential benefits and risks"],
    bullets: ["A comprehensive consultation looking at your health from head to toe","Primary care foundations confirmed first: screenings, lipids and blood pressure","A personalized plan for nutrition, exercise and goals","Hormone and peptide therapies considered only if warranted","Ongoing support, follow-ups and accountability","Pricing for these optional services discussed individually before you begin"],
    approachHeading: "How It Works",
    approachSubhead: "Every step is focused on creating lasting improvements in your health and overall well-being",
    approach: [{"title":"Understand Your Health","body":"We take the time to truly understand your body, your history, and your goals, so your plan starts with clarity and purpose.","iconPath":"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2 M9 12h6m-6 4h6"},{"title":"Build Your Plan","body":"From primary care to advanced wellness therapies, we create a personalized strategy covering nutrition, training, recovery and, if warranted, hormone optimization.","iconPath":"M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23-.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5"},{"title":"Move Forward Stronger","body":"We continue to refine your plan, helping you build strength and confidence for the long run. Steady forward progress with persistent motivation is the key to success.","iconPath":"M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182m0-4.991v4.99"}],
    benefits: [{"title":"More Energy","body":"Nutrition, training and recovery strategies are built to help you feel stronger and more energized day to day."},{"title":"Strength and Fitness","body":"Strength and aerobic optimization tailored to where you are starting, whether that is a first walk around the neighborhood or a new personal best."},{"title":"Physician Oversight","body":"Supplements, hormones and peptides are evaluated by a board-certified internal medicine physician who also knows your full medical history."},{"title":"Accountability","body":"You're never left figuring things out on your own. With consistent guidance, follow-ups, and direct access to your physician, you'll always have support."}],
    timelineHeading: "Your Path Forward",
    timeline: [{"title":"Personalized Health Assessment","body":"We take the time to understand your full health picture, history, lifestyle, and goals."},{"title":"Foundations First","body":"Preventive screenings, lipid management, blood pressure control and any chronic conditions are brought up to date."},{"title":"Your Performance Plan","body":"Nutrition, exercise and goal setting are tailored to you. Hormone optimization or peptide therapies are discussed only if warranted."},{"title":"Ongoing Refinement","body":"Consistent, proactive care keeps you on track. We monitor progress, adjust when needed, and stay connected to support your health."}],
    extraSections: [{"heading":"Pricing","body":["Wellness and performance services are optional and are separately contracted and priced, apart from the Body1MD primary care membership ($100 per month under age 50, $150 per month at age 50 and older). Because every plan is individual, pricing is discussed with you directly before anything begins."]},{"heading":"A Note on Hormones and Peptides","body":["Hormone optimization and peptide therapies are not a starting point. They are considered only if warranted by your symptoms, history and lab work, and only after Dr. Hemmen explains the potential benefits, risks and alternatives. Many people reach their goals with nutrition, training, sleep and goal setting alone."]}],
    faqs: [{"q":"Do I need to be an athlete?","a":"Not at all. These services are for anyone who wants to feel better, move better and live at their best, whatever their starting point."},{"q":"Are hormone or peptide therapies part of every plan?","a":"No. They are considered only if warranted, after a careful evaluation, and many plans never include them."},{"q":"How much do wellness and performance services cost?","a":"They are separately contracted and priced, and pricing is discussed individually before you begin. The primary care membership is $100 per month under age 50 and $150 per month at age 50 and older, month-to-month."},{"q":"What is inspired goal setting?","a":"If you can see it, you can achieve it! Inspired goal setting means defining a goal that genuinely motivates you, then mapping a realistic path to achieve it. Steady forward progress with persistent motivation is the key to success."},{"q":"Can supplements be part of my plan?","a":"Yes, when they make sense. Nutrition optimization plans can include supplements alongside food and lifestyle strategies, reviewed against your medications and health history."}],
